## ⚠️ Critical Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| **GPU-heavy animations on low-end Android** | App becomes unusable on budget phones (80% of Indian market) | Implement `prefers-reduced-motion` detection; disable aurora/mesh gradients on devices with <4GB RAM |
| **Socket.io scaling** | Single-server Socket.io won't handle 1000+ concurrent merchants | Use Redis adapter for Socket.io; consider Firebase Realtime DB as alternative |
| **OCR accuracy for handwritten lists** | Handwritten Devanagari/Marathi text has low OCR accuracy | Start with typed text support; add manual correction UI; phase in ML improvements |
| **Thermal printer fragmentation** | Dozens of printer models with different protocols | Support only 2-3 popular Indian models initially (TVS RP 3150, Epson TM-T82); add others based on demand |
| **Cart store for complex modifiers** | Current cart store doesn't support item variants/options | Add `customOptions` object to cart items (both plans propose this) — must be done BEFORE building modifier UIs |
| **Mobile app size bloat** | Adding barcode scanner + haptics + bottom sheets + animations | Use Expo config plugins for tree-shaking; lazy-load heavy screens |

